# 🚀 Features

- ✅ Minecraft Java Edition Support
- ✅ Fabric Loader
- ✅ Forge Support
- ✅ NeoForge Support
- ✅ Ely.by Account Login
- ✅ Microsoft Account Login
- ✅ Offline Login
- ✅ Java 8 / 17 / 21 Runtime
- ✅ Custom Runtime Manager
- ✅ FPS Overlay
- ✅ Custom Themes
- ✅ Landscape Mode
- ✅ Fullscreen Gameplay
- ✅ Custom Controls
- ✅ Performance Optimizations
- ✅ Automatic Version Installation
- ✅ Separate Game Directories
- ✅ Resource Pack Support
- ✅ Shader Support
- ✅ Mod Support

---

# 📥 Download

Download the latest version from the Releases page.

https://github.com/RXLauncherTeam/RxLauncher/releases

---

# 🛠 Building

Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/RXLauncherTeam/RxLauncher.git
```

Open the project

```bash
cd RxLauncher
```

Build APK

```bash
./gradlew assembleDebug
```

Release APK

```bash
./gradlew assembleRelease
```

---

# 📱 Requirements

• Android 7.0+
• OpenGL ES 3.0+
• 4GB RAM Recommended
• Internet Connection

